  Install task-board project integrations\\n  limits                 Inspect and control provider rate-limit state\\n  login                  Store a token for the current remote\\n  logout                 Remove active user's token for current remote\\n  m                      Execute a mutation (write operation)\\n  migrate-keychain       Import legacy remote credentials into macOS Keychain\\n  migrate-project-config Preview or apply guarded deprecated project-config alias migration\\n  plan                   Show execution plan with phases and critical path\\n  q                      Query the board with a mini DSL\\n  repair-links           List or remove unsupported container dependency links\\n  resource               Upload, update, download, and delete board resources\\n  self-update            Update task-board to the latest version\\n  session                Inspect and stop Task-board Session Manager sessions\\n  spawn                  Queue an agent spawn run for a board task\\n  switch-user            Switch active user for current remote\\n  tree                   Show board as hierarchical tree\\n  tui                    Launch interactive TUI\\n  validate               Validate board structure\\n  whoami                 Show current remote and active user\\n  worktree               Inspect and repair managed Story workspaces\\n\\nFlags:\\n      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n  -h, --help                     help for task-board\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n      --json                     Output in JSON format\\n      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n  -v, --version                  version for task-board\\n\\nUse \\\"task-board [command] --help\\\" for more information about a command.\\n===\\n LOGBOOK.md                | 12 ++++++++++++\\n README.md                 | 47 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n internal/axpane/decide.go |  5 ++++-\\n 3 files changed, 63 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\\n===\\nauth_test.go\\nauth.go\\nbodies_test.go\\nbodies.go\\nconformance_test.go\\ncontext_test.go\\ncontext.go\\ncrash_unix_test.go\\ndisposition_test.go\\ndisposition.go\\ndoc.go\\nerrors.go\\nexecute_test.go\\nexecute.go\\nfencing_test.go\\nfencing.go\\nfixtures_test.go\\nlifecycle_test.go\\nmutant_harness.py\\nproof.go\\nresult_test.go\\nresult.go\\nstatus_exec_test.go\\nstatus_test.go\\nstatus.go\\nstore_test.go\\nstore.go\\nTRACEABILITY.md\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3657,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 915,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
