des TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n      --json                     Output in JSON format\\n      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n\\n===\\nquery error: parse error at 1:1: unknown operation \\\"resources\\\" (got \\\"resources\\\"); known operations: activity, agents, context, context_boundary, context_candidates, context_retention, contexts, count, get, list, models, plan, project_config, provider_limits, schema, summary, whoami; see schema() for the contract and schema(operation=NAME) for one signature\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1795,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 449,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
