ll passes with identical verdict lists:\n93|68 narrowing KILLED + 1 tightening edge KILLED + control\n94|(`mutants/pass1/`, `mutants/pass2/`, 70 per-plant raw logs each with\n95|subprocess exits). One narrowing mutant per auth arm\n96|(`N-auth-*`), per mapping arm (`N-disp-*`), per enum\n97|(`N-proof-*`, `N-disp-parse`), per key/generation/timeout/version arm\n98|(`N-context-*`, `N-params-*`, `N-version-delegation`, `N-body-key`,\n99|`N-wait-timeout-bound`), per repetition member (8× `N-result-*`),\n100|per order/unique/sort half (`N-result-effects-order`,\n101|`N-result-evidence-unique`, `N-result-effects-sort`,\n102|`N-result-evidence-sort`), per body gate (`N-body-scope`,\n103|`N-body-members`), per receipt gate (`N-store-*`,\n104|`N-complete-unbound`), per fencing arm (`N-fencing-*`), per engine\n105|gate (`N-engine-*`, `N-status-nullpair`, `N-interim`), and the\n106|`C-control` SURVIVED control (see TRACEABILITY.md mutant table).","final_result":true}}}
