{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c71b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b28c-5604-75c0-aae6-73b3ca1e890f"},"sequence":488,"recorded_at":1780531400000971,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"d8b3c488-a0a9-443b-8e40-610c9c2591de","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"d8b3c488-a0a9-443b-8e40-610c9c2591de","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"d8b3c488-a0a9-443b-8e40-610c9c2591de"},"call_id":"call_01a0b28de43273cc967000462453c810","text":"Read text file `/tmp/kkh1an-rev2/TASK-260830-kkh1an_conformance-matrix.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-kkh1an — conformance matrix\n2|\n3|Authority: spec v0.5.0 (`28bf96d`), worked against\n4|`internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md` (§4.B-4.D, §5.2, §7.A, §13.1;\n5|§§4.B/4.C/4.D/5.2/7.A byte-identical to v0.6.0, §13.1 carries the\n6|v0.7.0 launch-plan pure-addition insertion with the terminal-entry\n7|rule text unchanged).\n8|Every row names the production entry and the committed test that\n9|drives it; 70 named top-level tests verified present via\n10|`go test -list` and 7 cited subtests verified `--- PASS` (zero\n11|missing; see `ratio-check.log` in the evidence archive). Full\n12|clause-to-test evidence with stated bounds:\n13|`internal/terminstance/TRACEABILITY.md` (72/72 AC rows, counted).\n14|\n15|## AXAuthorization (§4.C)\n16|\n17|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n18|| --- | --- | --- |\n19|| Closed 7-member object | `ParseAXAuthorization` | `TestParseAXAuthorizationAdmitsClosedFixture` |\n20|| lease_id UUIDv4 | `ParseAXAuthorization` | `TestParseAXAuthorizationMemberTypes` |\n21|| lease_epoch bound at 1, max, 0, max+1 | `ParseAXAuthorization` | `TestParseAXAuthorizationEpochBound` |\n22|| Epoch AX number model | `ParseAXAuthorization` | `TestParseAXAuthorizationEpochNumberModel` |\n23|| holder UUIDv7, kind closed 4, timestamps, digest | `ParseAXAuthorization` | member/kind/expiry tests |\n24|| Unknown/missing member, frame violations | `ParseAXAuthorization` | `TestParseAXAuthorizationClosedShape` |\n25|| Kind, expiry, lease binding | `CheckAuthorization` | `TestCheckAuthorizationAdmitsWinningLease`, `TestCheckAuthorizationRefusals` |\n26|\n27|## Closed enums and mapping (§4.C)\n28|\n29|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n30|| --- | --- | --- |\n31|| RetryDisposition closed 4 + census | `ParseRetryDisposition` | `TestParseRetryDispositionClosed`, `TestClosedEnumsAreExactlyPinned` |\n32|| Per-code mapping (26 rows) | `DispositionFor` | `TestDispositionForMapping` |\n33|| ProviderProofKind closed 3 + classification | `ParseProviderProofKind`, `RequiresProviderObservation` | proof tests |\n34|| AuthorizationKind closed 4 + census | `ParseAuthorizationKind` | `TestParseAuthorizationKindClosed` |\n35|\n36|## Request/result identity (§4.C)\n37|\n38|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n39|| --- | --- | --- |\n40|| MutationContext closed 10 + members, doc + Go twins | `ParseMutationContext` | `TestParseMutationContextAdmitsClosedFixture`, `TestParseMutationContextMemberRefusals`, `TestCheckMutationContextVersionArms` |\n41|| Generation 0/256/257 + multibyte | `ParseMutationContext`, `CheckMutationContext` | bound tests |\n42|| Key material exact per row | `KeySegments` | `TestKeySegmentsDerivesRowMaterial` |\n43|| Carried-key consistency | `CheckMutationContext` | `TestCheckMutationContextKeyMaterial` |\n44|| Per-op params | `CheckMutationContext` | `TestCheckMutationContextParams` |\n45|| Operation bodies closed + scope | `ParseOperationBody` | `TestParseOperationBodyAdmitsRows`, `TestParseOperationBodyRefusals`, `TestParseOperationBodyScopeGate` |\n46|| Status body + null-pair rule | `ParseStatusBody` | `TestParseStatusBodyAdmitsBothScopes`, `TestParseStatusBodyNullPairRule`, `TestParseStatusBodyMemberRefusals` |\n47|| Result repetition + shape + sorting | `CheckResult` | `TestCheckResultAdmitsEngineResult`, `TestCheckResultRepetitionTamper`, `TestCheckResultShapeArms`, `TestBuildResultSortsEffectsAndEvidence` |\n48|\n49|## State-entry rules (§4.C, §13.1)\n50|\n51|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n52|| --- | --- | --- |\n53|| creating only via create after receipt | `ExecuteMutating`, `InterimState` | `TestExecuteInterimState`, `TestExecuteReceiptPrecedesFirstEffect` |\n54|| Pre-first-effect errors restore source | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecutePreEffectErrorsRestoreSource` (5 subtests) |\n55|| Post-commit uncertainty to unavailable | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecutePostEffectErrorsMoveUnavailable` (4 subtests) |\n56|| Only quiesce enters quiescing | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteOnlyQuiesceEntersQuiescing` |\n57|| stale_fenced only via fencing (launch-class op) | `ObserveFencing` | `TestObserveFencingStaleEpochFences`, `TestObserveFencingLeaseMismatchFences` |\n58|| Non-stale observations leave state | `ObserveFencing` | `TestObserveFencingNonStaleLeavesState`, `TestObserveFencingStaleParkVocabulary` |\n59|| Per-effect auth+generation rechecks | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteRechecksBeforeEachEffect` (4 subtests) |\n60|| Deadline cancels waiting only | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteDeadlineNeverCancelsCommittedEffect`, `TestExecuteEntryDeadlineCodes` (4 subtests) |\n61|\n62|## Generation-safe evidence (§4.B, §7.A)\n63|\n64|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n65|| --- | --- | --- |\n66|| Bound in every owned surface | parse/check entries | rows 26, 36, 39 tests |\n67|| Stale refuses landed stale class | `ExecuteMutating` | entry + per-effect staleness tests |\n68|| Verdict agrees with landed digest | `checkGenerationBound` | `TestGenerationBoundAgreesWithLandedDigest` |\n69|| Row codes admitted by landed table | `CheckErrorAllowed` | `TestRowCodesAreAdmittedByCheckErrorAllowed` |\n70|| Descriptor bound | landed `terminalbackend` | cited landed (checkGeneration arms) |\n71|\n72|## Operation rows (§4.C, §5.2)\n73|\n74|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n75|| --- | --- | --- |\n76|| status same-state all 8 + unknown source, zero effects | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusAllSources` |\n77|| status adopts drifted state verbatim | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusAdoptsReportedState` |\n78|| status non-match adopts proven absent | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusNonMatchAdoptsAbsent` |\n79|| status unknown never absent | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusUnknownIsNeverAbsent` |\n80|| status report validation + member arms | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusReportValidation`, `TestExecuteStatusMatchedTupleFalseFormRefuses`, `TestExecuteStatusReportMemberRefusals` |\n81|| status conditionals + session scope | `ExecuteStatus` | `TestExecuteStatusProviderConditional`, `TestExecuteStatusSessionScoped` |\n82|| quiesce rows + refusal set | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteQuiesceSuccess`, `TestExecuteBackendRowErrorSets` |\n83|| wait rows + capabilities | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteWaitSuccess`, `TestExecuteWaitCapabilityConditionals` |\n84|| stop rows + order + both timeout directions | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteStopSuccess`, `TestExecuteBackendRowErrorSets` |\n85|| create receipt rule | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteCreateReceiptRule` |\n86|| Replay, mismatch, uncertain retry, sweep age-gate | `ExecuteMutating`, `ReceiptStore` | `TestExecuteIdenticalRetryReplays`, `TestExecuteChangedOperationInWindowMismatches`, `TestExecuteUncertainRetryRequiresStatus`, `TestStoreSweepKeepsLiveStaging`, `TestStoreSweepRemovesAgedStaging` |\n87|| Crash seam + status recovery | `ReceiptStore`, `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteCrashChildSelfTerminates` |\n88|| Conferral wiring + scope gate | `ExecuteMutating` | `TestExecuteEmptyAdmittedRefusesAtLandedGate` (4 subtests), `TestExecuteScopeGate` |\n89|\n90|## Negative-evidence index (narrowing mutants)\n91|\n92|70/70 harness rows on two full passes with identical verdict lists:\n93|68 narrowing KILLED + 1 tightening edge KILLED + control\n94|(`mutants/pass1/`, `mutants/pass2/`, 70 per-plant raw logs each with\n95|subprocess exits). One narrowing mutant per auth arm\n96|(`N-auth-*`), per mapping arm (`N-disp-*`), per enum\n97|(`N-proof-*`, `N-disp-parse`), per key/generation/timeout/version arm\n98|(`N-context-*`, `N-params-*`, `N-version-delegation`, `N-body-key`,\n99|`N-wait-timeout-bound`), per repetition member (8× `N-result-*`),\n100|per order/unique/sort half (`N-result-effects-order`,\n101|`N-result-evidence-unique`, `N-result-effects-sort`,\n102|`N-result-evidence-sort`), per body gate (`N-body-scope`,\n103|`N-body-members`), per receipt gate (`N-store-*`,\n104|`N-complete-unbound`), per fencing arm (`N-fencing-*`), per engine\n105|gate (`N-engine-*`, `N-status-nullpair`, `N-interim`), and the\n106|`C-control` SURVIVED control (see TRACEABILITY.md mutant table).","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
